Description:It is your first main phase. You control Grizzly Bears and have Smother (destroy target creature with mana value 3 or less) and Disfigure in hand, with two black mana floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls an untapped Endless One with five +1/+1 counters (a 5/5). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-x-zero-on-battlefield | X is 0 everywhere but on the stack (CR 107.3f, 202.3e), so the 5/5 Endless One has mana value 0 and Smother can destroy it, letting the Bears attack for 2; Disfigure leaves a 3/3 blocker, and the two black mana pay for only one of the spells
